89315826157-MO4VPYYD7JHS654I6GFT/IMG_8530+%281%29.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1589315826157-MO4VPYYD7JHS654I6GFT/IMG_8530+%281%29.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1589315826157-MO4VPYYD7JHS654I6GFT/IMG_8530+%281%29.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1589315826157-MO4VPYYD7JHS654I6GFT/IMG_8530+%281%29.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1589315826157-MO4VPYYD7JHS654I6GFT/IMG_8530+%281%29.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5da7d49f6a98d112691e4bbc/1589315826157-MO4VPYYD7JHS654I6GFT/IMG_8530+%281%29.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n          <figcaption data-sqsp-image-classic-block-caption-container class=\"image-caption-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"image-caption\"><p class=\"\">hello, beautiful.</p></div>\n          </figcaption>\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1589308445696_55174\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The sauce is chunky, as it should be—with finely diced onion, carrot, celery, garlic, and mushroom. You have all the right players in the pot: red wine, tomatoes, beef, pork, veggies, broth, and herbs. Let it simmer for 2 hours and finish off with cream and parmesan cheese, and—*chefs kiss*</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-bloc